 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5ksM5aeUQjkQ7kNvwEhPnmB&_nc_oc=AdqpDIKkzUZqa27-V-f5DVndDIKt-sRKyxY6v_-8eVuidJ7kGB2rWxUffGvNdSzBwl4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRqzUphwVRGAaYweF7o7IwO0ueIL4-OB_CFIh0SVzR4pA&oe=6AEDEFC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6ATgbQFWl5MQ7kNvwFQJlnM&_nc_oc=AdrTyj869GXDxDA5qKek0sTJf2hcpwXxz6pu97lnlUr-6yNn1yolq0TvxobEzWwNkHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSV9Id4O_f02h_tj1c6J-Vz_MWGRZmMRX6N3lB3RWTfEw&oe=6AEDFD26"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z6acd51sj00Q7kNvwGA6xv1&_nc_oc=Adqn32r52w05RGWcF3DbVOZcdWsMN5hzRVs4cR7VdgZ-CPeRmMY2i63OJ8Jc6GkWVmE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRfxkTAhf15_08_3HOjtxDDkLqYIbb0ROknkaljQ8mm4g&oe=6AEE071C"}, {"fil